<title>GERMANY: VEBA, C&amp;W in telecoms talks with RWE.</title>
<headline>VEBA, C&amp;W in telecoms talks with RWE.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified group VEBA AG said on Wednesday it and its partner Cable &amp; Wireless plc were in the final stages of talks on cooperation with RWE AG in the area of telecommunications.</p>
<p>&quot;VEBA will provide information on the outcome today,&quot; VEBA said in a brief statement.  </p>
<p>VEBA already cooperates with Cable &amp; Wireless through its telecommunications subsidiary Vebacom.</p>
<p>RWE, the energy group, had previously planned to enter into a telecoms alliance with diversified group Viag AG and British Telecom.</p>
<p>RWE had in April denied a newspaper report that it had re-opened negotiations with telecoms operators other than Viag and British Telecom.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
